# Sneak {1}{W} is cast only "during your declare blockers step" (CR 702.190a), returning an unblocked creature. It is refused
# in the main phase, and in the declare blockers step when the only attacker was blocked by Bot2's Ornithopter (so it has
# no creature to return, CR 509.1h). The control in the same step: the full cost {3}{W} (Black Lotus and a Plains) is paid
# for the same spell, and it is cast, making three untapped tokens that are not attacking - so it is the way, not the
# timing, that the refusal turns on; the unblocked sneak is the other scenario.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Ornithopter
The Last Ronin's Technique
Plains
Plains
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

